 ## How it works
 **Inputs:**
-- `normal`: The surface normal vector $\mathbf{n}$, assumed to be normalized ($|\mathbf{n}| = 1$).
-- `rng`: A source of pseudo-random numbers, typically providing two independent uniform random values in $[0, 1)$.
